 scale(.8333)" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-text-secondary)" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8.5 14.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 11 12c0-1.38-.5-2-1-3-1.072-2.143-.224-4.054 2-6 .5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5 2 1.6 3 3.5 3 5.5a7 7 0 1 1-14 0c0-1.153.433-2.294 1-3a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.5 2.5z"></path></g></svg></span><span><span class="bal-row-name">Inflation</span><span class="bal-row-state" data-side="neutral">Split: 1 for, 1 against</span></span><span class="bal-row-tally" data-balance-tally="true">1 for, 1 against</span><svg class="bal-chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="bal-members" id="gold-balance-row-inflation" hidden=""></div></li><li class="bal-row" data-open="false" data-balance-row="flows"><button type="button" id="gold-balance-row-btn-flows" class="bal-row-btn" data-balance-row-btn="flows" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="gold-balance-row-flows"><span class="bal-disc"><svg viewBox="0 0 60 60" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" style="width: 40px; height: 40px; display: block; overflow: visible;"><g><path data-bal-seg="unread" d="M 31.88 3.07 A 27 27 0 0 1 31.88 56.93" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-border)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="1.4 3.2"></path><path data-bal-seg="unread" d="M 28.12 56.93 A 27 27 0 0 1 28.12 3.07" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-border)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="1.4 3.2"></path></g><g class="bal-disc-face"><circle cx="30" cy="30" r="20" fill="url(#bal-face-stone)"></circle><circle cx="30" cy="30" r="19.4" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.55)" stroke-width=".8"></circle><circle cx="30" cy="30" r="15.6" fill="none" stroke="rgba(0,0,0,.14)" stroke-width=".7"></circle></g></svg></span><span><span class="bal-row-name">Flows &amp; demand</span><span class="bal-row-state" data-side="unread">Couldn’t be read</span></span><span class="bal-row-tally" data-balance-tally="true"></span><svg class="bal-chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="bal-members" id="gold-balance-row-flows" hidden=""></div></li></ul><p data-balance-measured-note="true" class="bal-foot">Measured against gold’s actual moves over 2016 to 2026: the lean of these drivers showed no positive association with the next 5 to 60 days. If anything, readings against gold came before larger rises. It describes conditions, not direction. <a href="https://github.com/assadigit/Currena/blob/main/docs/insights/BACKTEST-GOLD-LANES.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="insights-focusable">Read the full backtest</a></p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-[var(--color-border)] pt-3"><h4 class="m-0 text-[length:var(--type-label)] font-bold text-[var(--color-text-tertiary)]">Price footing</h4><ul class="m-0 flex list-none flex-col gap-1.5 p-0"><li class="flex flex-col gap-0.5 rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] bg-[var(--color-surface)] px-2.5 py-2 ring-1 ring-[var(--color-border)]" data-footing-metal="gold" data-footing-state="against"><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" draggable="false" decoding="async" class="currena-icon shrink-0 select-none " style="--icon-size: 24px; --icon-size-sm: 30px;" src="/assets/icons/gold.png"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 text-[var(--color-status-alert)]"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M2.5 6.5l4 4 2.5-2.5 4.5 5"></path></svg><span class="text-[length:var(--type-label)] font-bold">Works against</span></span></span><span class="text-[length:var(--type-label)] font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Gold</span><bdi dir="ltr" class="text-[length:var(--type-caption)] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">US$3,876</bdi><span class="text-[length:var(--type-caption)] text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">high of the last 10 years</span><span class="ms-auto flex items-baseline gap-1 text-[length:var(--type-caption)] text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">30-day speed:<bdi dir="ltr" class="font-semibold tabular-nums">−7.76%</bdi></span></span><span class="text-[length:var(--type-label)] leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">A price holding or rising in its 10-year range is firm footing; a falling one is not.</span></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-0.5 rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] bg-[var(--color-surface)] px-2.5 py-2 ring-1 ring-[var(--color-border)]" data-footing-metal="silver" data-footing-state="unknown"><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" draggable="false" decoding="async" class="currena-icon shrink-0 select-none " style="--icon-size: 24px; --icon-size-sm: 30px;" src="/assets/icons/silver.png"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 text-[var(--color-status-stale)]"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6.2"></circle><path d="M8 4.6V8l2.4 1.6"></path></svg><span class="text-[length:var(--type-label)] font-bold">Cannot read</span></span></span><span class="text-[length:var(--type-label)] font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Silver</span></span><span class="text-[length:var(--type-label)] leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">A price holding or rising in its 10-year range is firm footing; a falling one is not.</span></li></ul></div>"`;
